// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3012793785" "The Hellions have been found with a lot of stolen artifacts lately. Some of the things they're carrying are quite powerful and corrupting; they shouldn't be in the hands of the wisest men on Earth, let alone a bunch of thugs. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to hit the streets and see if you can wrest some of these artifacts from the Hellions.</A>"
