// Task - SL2_Hellions_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2785127086" "I guess the Hellions think they own Perez Park now. In fact, they've been extorting tolls from citizens who wander through the neighborhoods they consider their turf. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to put an end to the Hellions' extortion in Perez Park.</A> Make it clear that they're not the law around there and that the people are taking their city back from scum like them."
// AcceptString :
"P1697354661" "Put an end to the Hellions' extortion in Perez Park"
// SendOffString :
"P3873904851" "The Hellions and the Skulls have been waging street fights all over Perez Park for years. You can find the Hellions in an area known as Hell's Highway."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3233373293" "Combat Hellions in Perez Park"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2844887960" "The Hellions are still forcing the citizens of Perez Park to pay for their safety. That isn't right."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P127634014" "You have stopped the Hellions from extorting money from the citizens of Perez Park."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3201918129" "The people of Perez Park can walk down the streets without fear again. I can't think of anything more important than that."
